ation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. Requirements: - `spender` cannot be the zero address."},"increasePool(uint256)":{"params":{"amount":"Amount of staking tokens (in wei) that should be added to rewards pool"}},"name()":{"details":"Returns the name of the token."},"setClaimingFeePercent(uint256)":{"params":{"feePercent":"New claiming fee percent"}},"setUnstakingTime(uint256)":{"params":{"unstakingTime_":"New unstaking process duration in seconds"}},"stake(uint256)":{"params":{"amount":"Amount of staking tokens to be swapped"},"returns":{"mintedAmount":"Amount of synthetic tokens that was received at swapping process"}},"stakeForUser(address,uint256)":{"params":{"account":"Receiver of synthetic tokens","amount":"Amount of staking tokens to be swapped"},"returns":{"mintedAmount":"Amount of synthetic tokens that was received by specified account at swapping process"}},"symbol()":{"details":"Returns the symbol of the token, usually a shorter version of the name."},"totalSupply()":{"details":"See {IERC20-totalSupply}."},"transfer(address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transfer}. Requirements: - `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - the caller must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20}; Requirements: - `sender` and `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - `sender` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for ``sender``'s tokens of at least `amount`."},"unstake(uint256)":{"params":{"amount":"Minimum amount of staking tokens that should be locked after swapping process"},"returns":{"burnedAmount":"Amount of synthetic tokens that was burned","unstakedAmount":"Amount of staking tokens that was locked"}},"update()":{"details":"Automatically has been called on every contract action, that uses or can affect price"}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"calculateUnstake(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Calculates expected result of swapping synthetic tokens for staking tokens"},"cancelUnstaking(uint256)":{"notice":"Cancels unstaking by staking locked for withdrawals tokens"},"claim(uint256)":{"notice":"Swaps synthetic tokens for staking tokens and immediately sends them to the caller but takes some fee"},"claimFees()":{"notice":"Withdraws all staking tokens, that have been accumulated in imidiatly claiming process.     Allowed to be called only by the owner"},"createNewStrategy(uint256,uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Creates new strategy. Allowed to be called only by the owner"},"increasePool(uint256)":{"notice":"Increases pool of rewards"},"price()":{"notice":"Calculates price of synthetic token for current block"},"priceStored()":{"notice":"Returns last updated price of synthetic token"},"setClaimingFeePercent(uint256)":{"notice":"Change claiming fee percent. Can be called only by the owner"},"setUnstakingTime(uint256)":{"notice":"Change unstaking time. Can be called only by the owner"},"stake(uint256)":{"notice":"Converts staking tokens to synthetic tokens"},"stakeForUser(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Converts staking tokens to synthetic tokens and sends them to specific account"},"unstake(uint256)":{"notice":"Swapes synthetic tokens for staking tokens and locks them for some period"},"update()":{"notice":"Updates price of synthetic token"},"withdraw()":{"notice":"Withdraws unstaked staking tokens"}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"StakingPool.sol":"StakingPool"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":false,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"Address.sol":{"keccak256":"0x42b040c5389fef91ea8637793e754d7c059a718275c9c12d6e21204b2a9b46e2","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://d192b621b224665760aa1ac8e9ac75c576f1f0480c889001eadd9c56b74292